WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:01.630
- Welcome back.

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.770
How is it the end of our show already?

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.090
I'd love to use our last
few moments together

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.980
to answer some of your questions.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.750
First up, social media
questions were on fire today.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.770
Don asking a tough one via
Twitter, "Waffles or pancakes?"

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:16.730
Neither, sausages.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:18.680
Hello, virtual friends.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.193
Who has a question? Christina?

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.670
- Yes. Hi.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:24.376
- How are you?

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:26.380
- Good. I love you so much.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.850
- I love you too, Christina.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.820
Do you have a question?

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:30.660
- I do.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.400
I know that you just seem so fearless,

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.810
and I just want to know
what your biggest fear is.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:40.290
- Oh, Christina, my god,
that's a good question.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.150
I'm afraid of anything bad
happening to the people I love.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.740
That's probably a common fear.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.410
It's straight to the
protection, the ones I love.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.780
Other than that, I say in life,

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.600
you got to go for it and be fearless.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.030
Love the ones you love, but go for it,

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:01.320
and never forget to make the
most of every single day.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.903
(upbeat music)

